  "warnings": [
    "No explicit ASME/ISO/DIN standard designation is printed. Third-angle projection and inch units are explicit; GD&T uses legacy frame ordering.",
    "143-C is the complete printed drawing/part number; C has not been assumed to be a revision. Revision table is blank. Model number is 250 BX.",
    "The first hole location is explicitly approximate, FIT AT ASSY. All reported edge-referenced X coordinates are nominal and inherit this assembly adjustment; do not treat them as exact final manufacturing positions.",
    "The positional tolerance is a diameter .010 zone with no datum references printed. Do not invent datum A in that frame; clarify inspection requirements if needed.",
    "Basic dimensions have no supported basic tolerance_type in the reporting schema; they are identified in notes and must not receive the general three-place bilateral tolerance.",
    "H markings indicate hardening, not geometric features. The 2.50 and 1.50 dimensions define hardening band heights on opposing broad faces; the bottom edge is the third hardened surface. These treatments extend longitudinally as indicated by H.",
